      "title": "Runtime Truth",
      "items": [
        "当前入口是 uvicorn backend.asgi:app；FastAPI 是唯一 production/native runtime。",
        "/healthz 明确返回 runtime=fastapi、fastapiPrimary=true、flaskFallback=false；没有 Flask/WSGI fallback 节点。"
